# Software Factory

This project has the Software Factory pack installed for Cursor. Start or
resume factory work with the `software-factory` skill; its entry point is
`.agents/skills/software-factory/SKILL.md`.

The six entry and admin skills (software-factory, sf-help, sf-agents,
sf-evolve, sf-eval, sf-principles) are explicit-only: invoke them by name
with `/`. The working skills stay available automatically.

Factory-owned files are listed in `.software-factory/installation.json`;
runtime state lives under `.software-factory/` and is ignored except for
the committed `context/` home.
